<% h = ->(value) { CGI.escapeHTML(value.to_s) } -%>
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Field notes / Mario Mendez</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/personal.css"><link rel="describedby" href="../llms.txt"><link rel="alternate" type="application/json" href="../profile.json" title="Prototype professional record"><script src="../assets/personal.js" defer></script></head><body class="journal personal personal-notebook"><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="wrap"><header class="site-head"><a class="brand" href="index.html">Mario Mendez</a><nav class="nav" aria-label="Main"><a href="index.html" aria-current="page">Writing</a><a href="history.html">Experience</a><a class="agent-nav" href="../agents/index.html">For agents</a><a href="mailto:mmendezdiaz@outlook.com">Email</a></nav></header>
<main id="main"><section class="intro"><div><h1>Hi, I’m Mario.</h1><p>CTO, founder, programmer. I run marathons, head out on multi-day bike trips, and like cats. I like trying things I “shouldn’t” be doing.</p><p>This is where I keep the things I learn. Some are about software. A lot turn out to be about people.</p><div class="intro-links"><a href="history.html">My work history</a><a href="https://github.com/mario-evo">GitHub</a></div></div><%= ERB.new(File.read('design-review/templates/personal-scene.erb'), trim_mode:'-', eoutvar:'_scene_output').result(binding) %></section>
<a class="mobile-agent-link" href="../agents/index.html">For your agent: profile, history &amp; writing</a>
<div class="notebook-columns"><section aria-labelledby="writing-title"><div class="heading-row"><h2 id="writing-title">From the notebook</h2><a href="#archive">Older posts</a></div><% posts.first(2).each do |post| -%><article class="notebook-post"><time class="meta" datetime="<%= post[:iso] %>"><%= post[:date] %></time><h3><a href="<%= post[:slug] %>.html"><%= h.call(post[:title]) %></a></h3><p><%= h.call(post[:summary]) %></p><a class="read" href="<%= post[:slug] %>.html">Read the post</a></article><% end -%><section class="notebook-archive" id="archive"><div class="heading-row"><h2>Earlier experiments</h2></div><% posts.drop(2).each do |post| -%><div class="archive-entry"><time datetime="<%= post[:iso] %>"><%= post[:year] %></time><a href="<%= post[:slug] %>.html"><%= h.call(post[:title]) %></a></div><% end -%></section></section>
<aside class="side" aria-label="Agent access and personal interests"><section class="agent-panel" style="margin-top:0"><span class="file-mark">For you + your agent</span><h2>Send your agent here.</h2><p>A plain-text profile, my work history, and the writing. Easy to read yourself or hand to an agent.</p><a class="agent-link" href="../agents/index.html">Get the agent briefing</a><div class="agent-formats"><a href="../profile.md">Markdown</a><a href="../profile.json">JSON</a></div></section><section><h2>Off the keyboard</h2><div class="interest"><img src="../assets/bicycle-mark.svg" alt=""><div><h3>The long way round</h3><p>Multi-day bike trips. Seeing how far I can go, then doing it again tomorrow.</p></div></div><div class="interest"><img src="../assets/mountain-mark.svg" alt=""><div><h3>One more step</h3><p>I’ve run several marathons. I like the slow work of getting somewhere that used to feel out of reach.</p></div></div><div class="interest"><img src="../assets/cat-mark.svg" alt=""><div><h3>And cats</h3><p>Not everything needs to be an endurance event.</p></div></div></section><section class="notebook-contact"><h2>Say hello</h2><a href="mailto:mmendezdiaz@outlook.com">Email</a><br><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mario-mendez-d/">LinkedIn</a><br><a href="history.html">Professional history</a></section></aside></div></main><footer class="foot"><span>Mario Mendez</span><div><a href="https://mariomendez.me/feed.xml">RSS</a><a class="agent-footer" href="../agents/index.html">For agents</a><a href="https://github.com/mario-evo">GitHub</a></div></footer><div class="review-strip"><span>Local preview / Field notes</span><a href="../personal.html">Compare layouts</a></div></div></body></html>
